WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.800
Hey, what's going on, everyone?

00:01.800 --> 00:02.640
Luke Busani here.

00:02.640 --> 00:04.160
I just want to give a quick shout out

00:04.160 --> 00:06.680
to my boy and partner, Johnny Brock.

00:06.680 --> 00:09.760
He's been incredibly helpful when it comes to marketing.

00:09.760 --> 00:12.640
They've literally taught me everything from A to Z.

00:12.640 --> 00:13.940
No prior experience.

00:13.940 --> 00:16.400
I've been in the industry the last four years,

00:16.400 --> 00:19.400
paying for live transfers, direct mail leads,

00:19.400 --> 00:20.760
Facebook leads, you name it.

00:20.760 --> 00:23.640
But being able to have full control over my marketing

00:23.640 --> 00:25.200
has really changed my business.

00:25.200 --> 00:29.460
And I couldn't be more thankful for Johnny and his team

00:29.460 --> 00:32.980
providing the support and everything

00:32.980 --> 00:35.420
that I've learned so far and extremely excited

00:35.420 --> 00:36.220
on what's to come.

00:36.220 --> 00:39.420
So just want to give a quick shout out to him and his team

00:39.420 --> 00:43.300
and look forward to continuing to grow.

